[Desktop Entry]
Name=UOSPingView
Name[zh_CN]=批量网络监控工具 (PingInfoView)
Comment=Multi-Host Ping Monitor for UOS
Comment[zh_CN]=统信 UOS 批量多目标网络连通性监控工具
